Audited 31 calibrated seeded interpolation declarations: actual independent seed law, variance t+ε, dominated differentiation, signed common cubic −t/3 and three actual fourth rows.
The arbitrary C¹ amplitude version, Slepian initialization and Appendix B analytic derivative budgets remain separate.
